OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry through
OL,6,Fthe evening with lengthy clear spells.
OL,7,FIt will stay dry overnight with mostly
OL,8,Fclear skies leading to some frost in
OL,9,Fplaces again and also some fog patches.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FSunny start with an early
OL,12,Ffrost, and any fog soon clearing.
OL,13,FTurning cloudy from the southeast
OL,14,Fduring the day some patchy light rain
OL,15,Fpossible, probably brightening in
OL,16,Fsoutheast later.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,19,Frather changeable few days, with
OL,20,Fspells of bright and dry weather
OL,21,Fbetween bands of rain.
